Shares Lending Agreement

This agreement entered today, the 19th of September 2012, between
Lendee, Mircea Popescu, as mircea_popescu, undersigned
Lender BTC-Mining, as Namjies, undersigned

For the purpose that the Lender shall lend to the Lendee a block of 1247 shares
in ASICMINER on GLBSE by transmitting them to Michael "smickles" Carver ;
And that the Lendee shall pay to the Lender on October the 19th, November the 19
th and December the 19th any and all such dividends as the shares accrued in the
 interval since the lending (for the first date) or since the previous payment (
for the later dates) ;
And that the Lendee shall pay to the Lender on October the 19th, November the 19
th and December the 19th 1% of average price of ASICMINER during the 5 days prev
ious as reported by GLBSE, except should there be no trades during the previous
five days he shall pay nothing on this count ;
And that the Lendee shall cause the shares be returned to the Lender on December
 the 19th, 2012, or at his preference pay their value calculated as the average
price during the past five days, except if ASICMINER should have become disconti
nued or are no longer traded in which case a token payment of 1 BTC shall be suf
ficient.

Further stipulated that the Lender shall pay the fees for transferring to the Le
ndee, and the Lendee shall pay the fees for transferring back to the Lender, if
any.

Signed by each party for the benefit of the other.
